    <entry>
      <title>API学习总结</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/07/api%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/api%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/07/api%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/api%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="1、CreateFileW函数"><a href="#1、CreateFileW函数" class="headerlink" title="1、CreateFileW函数"></a>1、CreateFileW函数</h2><p>创建或打开文件或I&#x2F;O设备（文件、文件流、目录、物理磁盘、卷、控制台缓冲区、磁带驱动器、通信资源、mailslot和管道）。它会返回一个句柄，可用于访问各个类型的I&#x2F;O文件或设备，具体取决于文件或设备以及指定的标志属性。</p><p><strong>语法：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">HANDLE <span class="title function_">CreateFile</span><span class="params">(</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] LPCWSTR lpFileName,<span class="comment">//文件路径(宽字符)</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] DWORD dwDesiredAccess,<span class="comment">//访问模式</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] DWORD dwShareMode,<span class="comment">//共享模式</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in, optional] LPSECURITY_ATTRIBUTES lpSecurityAttributes,<span class="comment">//安全属性</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] DWORD dwCreationDisposition,<span class="comment">//创建方式</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] DWORD dwFlagsAndAttributes,<span class="comment">//文件属性</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in, optional] HANDLE hTemplateFile<span class="comment">//模板文件</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>LPCWSTR（Long Pointer to Constant Wide String）指向常量宽字符串的长指针 实际类型：const wchar_t* 。 用途：指向Unicode（UTF-16）字符串的只读指针</p><p>DWORD（Double Word）双字（32位无符号整数） 实际类型：unsigned long 。 用途：存储各种标志和模式值</p><p>LPSECURITY_ATTRIBUTES（Long Pointer to SECURITIY_ATTRIBUTES）指向安全属性结构的长指针 实际类型：struct _SECURITY_ATTRIBUTES*。 用途：指定文件的安全性和继承性</p><p>HANDLE（Handle）句柄（INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE表示无效句柄）是个标识符 实际类型：void* 。 用途：引用系统资源（文件、进程、线程等）</p><p><strong>常用参数：</strong></p><p>[ in ] dwDesiredAccess GENERIC_READ（只读访问）、GENERIC_WRITE（只写访问）、GENERIC_READ|GENERIC_WRITE（同时具有读写权限）</p><p>[ in ] dwShareMode（控制其他进程如何访问同一文件） FILE_SHARE_READ（允许其他进程读取该文件）、FILE_SHARE_WRITE（..写入..）、FILE_SHARE_DELETE（..删除..）</p><p>[in, optional] lpSecurityAttributes：指向包含两个独立但相关数据成员的 <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/windows/win32/api/wtypesbase/ns-wtypesbase-security_attributes">SECURITY_ATTRIBUTES</a> 结构的指针：可选的安全描述符，以及一个布尔值，该值确定是否可由子进程继承返回的句柄。</p><p>此参数可以 NULL。</p><p>如果此参数 NULL，则应用程序可能创建的任何子进程都无法继承由 CreateFile 返回的句柄，并且与返回的句柄关联的文件或设备将获取默认的安全描述符。</p><p>[ in ] dwCreationDisposition（对文件或设备执行操作）（对于文件以外的设备参数设置为OPEN_EXISTING） 此参数的值为：（不能组合） CREATE_ALWAYS：创造新文件</p><p>CREATE_NEW：该文件不存在时才会创建新文件</p><p>OPEN_ALWAYS：打开文件</p><p>OPEN_EXISTING：文件或设备存在才打开，若不存在函数失败</p><p>TRUNCAT_EXISTING：文件存在时，打开一个文件并截断它，让它大小为零字节</p><p>[ in ] dwFlagsAndAttributes（文件或设备属性和标志） FILE_ATTRIBUTE_NORMAL是文件最常见的默认值</p><p>[in, optional] hTemplateFile（具有GENRIC_READ访问权限的模板文件的有效句柄）</p><p>打开现有文件时，CreateFile忽略此参数。</p><p><strong>返回值：</strong></p><p>函数成功返回值是：指定文件、设备、命名管道或邮件槽的打开句柄</p><p>函数失败返回值为：INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE</p><p>使用 CreateFile返回的对象句柄完成应用程序后，请使用 <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/windows/desktop/api/handleapi/nf-handleapi-closehandle">CloseHandle</a> 函数关闭句柄。</p><h2 id="2、ReadFile函数"><a href="#2、ReadFile函数" class="headerlink" title="2、ReadFile函数"></a>2、ReadFile函数</h2><p>从指定文件或设备读取数据，此函数用于同步操作和异步操作。</p><p>如果设备支持，则读取发生在文件指针指定的位置。（古书中有记载）</p><p><strong>语法：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">BOOL <span class="title function_">ReadFile</span><span class="params">(</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] HANDLE hFile,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[out] LPVOID lpBuffer,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] DWORD nNumberOfBytesToRead,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[out, optional] LPDWORD lpNumberOfBytesRead,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in, out, optional] LPOVERLAPPED lpOverlapped</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>参数：</strong><br>[ in ] hFile</p><p>若异步操作中FILE_FLAG_OVERLAPPED 标志打开的任何句柄</p><p>[ out ] lpBuffer（指向接收从文件或设备读取的缓冲区的指针）</p><p>[ in ] nNumberOfBytesToRead（要读取的最大字节数）</p><p>[ out, optional ] lpNumberOfBytesRead（指向同步hFile参数接收读取的字节数的变量的指针）</p><p>ReadFile在执行工作或检查错误要将这个值设置为0，若为异步操作用NULL</p><p>[ in, out, optional ] lpOverlapped（用于支持<strong>异步I&#x2F;O操作</strong>的关键结构体指针）</p><p>若使用了异步操作中FILE_FLAG_OVERLAPPED打开hFile参数则需要指向OVERLAPPED结构指针，否则可以为NULL 重叠结构（minwinbase.h）包含用于异步 (或 重叠) 输入和输出 (I&#x2F;O) 的信息</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">typedef</span> <span class="class"><span class="keyword">struct</span> _<span class="title">OVERLAPPED</span> &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ULONG_PTR Internal;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ULONG_PTR InternalHigh;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="class"><span class="keyword">union</span> &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="class"><span class="keyword">struct</span> &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">DWORD Offset;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">DWORD OffsetHigh;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125; DUMMYSTRUCTNAME;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">PVOID Pointer;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125; DUMMYUNIONNAME;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">HANDLE hEvent;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125; OVERLAPPED, *LPOVERLAPPED;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>返回值：</strong></p><p>函数成功返回值是：非零</p><h2 id="3、WriteFile函数"><a href="#3、WriteFile函数" class="headerlink" title="3、WriteFile函数"></a>3、WriteFile函数</h2><p>将数据写入指定的文件或输入&#x2F;输出（I&#x2F;O）设备。（WriteFileEx严格采用异步模式，WriteFile默认同步）</p><p><strong>语法：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">BOOL <span class="title function_">WriteFile</span><span class="params">(</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] HANDLE hFile,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] LPCVOID lpBuffer,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] DWORD nNumberOfBytesToWrite,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[out, optional] LPDWORD lpNumberOfBytesWritten,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in, out, optional] LPOVERLAPPED lpOverlapped</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>参数与返回值与ReadFile一样</strong></p><h2 id="4、CloseHandle-HANDLE-hObject-函数"><a href="#4、CloseHandle-HANDLE-hObject-函数" class="headerlink" title="4、CloseHandle(HANDLE hObject)函数"></a>4、CloseHandle(HANDLE hObject)函数</h2><p>关闭打开的对象句柄。</p><p><strong>语法：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">BOOL <span class="title function_">CloseHandle</span><span class="params">(</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] HANDLE hObject</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>参数：</strong></p><p>[ in ] hObject</p><p>打开对象的有效句柄</p><p><strong>返回值：</strong></p><p>成功：非零</p><p>失败：为零</p><h2 id="5、GetFileSizeEx函数"><a href="#5、GetFileSizeEx函数" class="headerlink" title="5、GetFileSizeEx函数"></a>5、GetFileSizeEx函数</h2><p>检索指定文件的大小。(windows应用商店应用不支持)</p><p><strong>语法：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">BOOL <span class="title function_">GetFileSizeEx</span><span class="params">(</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] HANDLE hFile,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[out] PLARGE_INTEGER lpFileSize</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>参数：</strong></p><p>[ out ] lpFileSize（指向接收文件大小，以字节为单位）</p><p>指向LARGE_INTEGER结构的指针</p><p><strong>返回值：</strong></p><p>成功：非零</p><p>失败：为零</p><h2 id="6、GetFileAttributesW函数"><a href="#6、GetFileAttributesW函数" class="headerlink" title="6、GetFileAttributesW函数"></a>6、GetFileAttributesW函数</h2><p>检索指定文件或目录的文件系统属性。</p><p><strong>语法：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">DWORD <span class="title function_">GetFileAttributesW</span><span class="params">(</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] LPCWSTR lpFileName</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>参数：</strong></p><p>[ in ] lpFileName（文件&#x2F;目录的名称）</p><p>名称限制为MAX_PATH个字符</p><p><strong>返回值：</strong></p><p>成功：包含指定文件或目录的属性</p><p>失败：返回值INVALID_FILE_ATTRIBUTES</p><h2 id="7、-CreateDirectoryW函数"><a href="#7、-CreateDirectoryW函数" class="headerlink" title="7、 CreateDirectoryW函数"></a>7、 CreateDirectoryW函数</h2><p>创建新目录</p><p><strong>语法：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">BOOL <span class="title function_">CreateDirectoryW</span><span class="params">(</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in] LPCWSTR lpPathName,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">[in, optional] LPSECURITY_ATTRIBUTES lpSecurityAttributes</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">)</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>参数：</strong></p><p>[ in ] lpPathName（要创建的目录的路径）</p><p>名称限制为MAX_PATH个字符</p><p>[ in ,optional ] lpSecurityAttributes</p><p>指向SECURITY_ATTRIBUTES结构的指针</p><p>（SECURITY_ATTRIBUTES是 Windows API 定义的结构体，核心作用是 为内核对象（如文件、进程、线程、管道、互斥体等）配置「安全访问规则」和「句柄继承性」。）</p><p>如果 lpSecurityAttributesNULL，则目录将获取默认的安全描述符</p><p><strong>返回值：</strong></p><p>成功：非0</p><p>失败：为0，若要获取扩展错误信息，调用GetLastError</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
